  "html": "<div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:202px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Dumdadumdum.jpg\" title=\" -- Don \"><img alt=\" -- Don \" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"179\" src=\"/images/Dumdadumdum.jpg\" width=\"200\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/Dumdadumdum.jpg\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div><b> -- Don </b></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:152px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Abaddon.png\" title=\"-- Donna\"><img alt=\"-- Donna\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"334\" src=\"/images/recovered/Abaddon.png\" width=\"150\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/recovered/Abaddon.png\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div><b>-- Donna</b></div></div></div>\n<p>Many of the Storerooms located off of <a href=\"/wiki/The_Embercore_Path\" title=\"The Embercore Path\">The Embercore Path</a> contain Candy Fabricator Machines guarded by <a href=\"/wiki/Abba_Labba\" title=\"Abba Labba\">Abba Labbas</a> and a <a href=\"/wiki/Candy_Golem\" title=\"Candy Golem\">Candy Golem</a> and led by a champion whose name is a takeoff on Abbadon's.  They are:\n</p>\n<table>\n<tr>\n<td>Storeroom 1A\n</td><td> Abbazabbadon\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Storeroom 3A\n</td><td> Abbadabbadoodon\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Storeroom 4A\n</td><td> Abracadabradonna\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Storeroom 5A\n</td><td>Abbadunkadunkadonna\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Storeroom 7A\n</td><td> Abbadumdadumdumdon\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Storeroom 7B\n</td><td> Abbadupercalifragilisticexpialidonna\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
